{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/783773-beasts-i-am-my-own-dinner","id":783773,"title":"Beasts: I am my own dinner?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-10T17:21:55-08:00","id":783773,"title":"Beasts: I am my own dinner?","content":"In a game I ran earlier this week a Summer Court changeling cheated a Beast at pool and then harvested Glamour from his anger, to which the Beast promptly turned around and used Family Dinner to recover Satiety. I looked over the rules for Family Dinner, and as best I can interpret it this is a valid use of the power. It's definitely qualifies as a feeding, at least. I don't have a problem with that, it just strikes me as amusing that Beasts can get Satiety from being the main course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T18:39:09-08:00","id":783820,"title":"","content":"I don't think Family Dinner works if the subject of the feeding is willing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T18:57:36-08:00","id":783835,"title":"","content":"There are two parts to family dinner, feeding and hunt. It doesn't qualify as a hunt if the target is willing, but it still qualifies as a feeding. <span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT\"> Tame targets such as vampiric minions who willing allow themselves to be \u201chunted\u201d do not qualify as proper targets for Family Dinner; the hunt must be genuine. </span><br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure that's only referring to the 'Witness a Hunt' Satiety and does not prevent the 'Witness a Feeding' Satiety. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T18:58:39-08:00","id":783837,"title":"","content":"Well, you can eat your own fingers, too. It's just that feelings aren't finite things. And, it doesn't sounds like the Beast was a willing participant. Wouldn't have gotten mad about it otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T19:00:10-08:00","id":783838,"title":"","content":"Neither is blood, if you have Relentless Hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T19:32:36-08:00","id":783861,"title":"","content":"Seems fair to me. I mean I doubt its something that can be done that often, but yeah it all checks out if I'm understanding it properly.<br /> Essentially it was Changeling and Beast played pool. The Changeling won and then the Beast found out about the cheating and the Beast got nettled at the Changeling. The Changeling gets glamour from evoking the response from the Beast. The pool game can be argued as the hunt and the feeding portion is obvious, so yeah it all seems fair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T19:15:42-08:00","id":786436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HelmsDerp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/783773-beasts-i-am-my-own-dinner?p=783835#post783835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are two parts to family dinner, feeding and hunt. It doesn't qualify as a hunt if the target is willing, but it still qualifies as a feeding. <span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT\"> Tame targets such as vampiric minions who willing allow themselves to be \u201chunted\u201d do not qualify as proper targets for Family Dinner; the hunt must be genuine. </span><br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure that's only referring to the 'Witness a Hunt' Satiety and does not prevent the 'Witness a Feeding' Satiety.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, you can choose to read it as something other than what it plainly says, but it plainly says that they aren't proper targets for Family Dinner, which is the name for the entire mechanic, not just the Hunting portion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T19:24:17-08:00","id":786443,"title":"","content":"So what qualifies for a feeding but not a hunt? The two are very deliberately separated, which means they must in some sense be, y'know, separable. If you can't witness a viable feeding that was not the result of a hunt, what does it even mean to gain one satiety from witnessing a feeding?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T20:24:52-08:00","id":786470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HelmsDerp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/783773-beasts-i-am-my-own-dinner?p=786443#post786443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what qualifies for a feeding but not a hunt? The two are very deliberately separated, which means they must in some sense be, y'know, separable. If you can't witness a viable feeding that was not the result of a hunt, what does it even mean to gain one satiety from witnessing a feeding?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm guessing you need to have seen the lead up to the feeding or at least a good portion of it. Like if I walk into a room and there's a vampire biting into someone's neck then all I'm seeing is the feeding. Another would be if you could see the lead up, but for whatever reason you couldn't observe the payoff. Like a tyrant uncovering the information they'll need to put a rival under their thumb would be the hunt, but unless you can find a way to be there when they reveal it to the person then all you see is the hunt.<br /> <br /> As a simile it would be like swiping a few carrots or some slices of fruit off someone else's plate, but not like managing to walk off with a wing like witnessing the entire thing would.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3400,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","user":"nalak42","date":". 12-15-2015, 01:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T20:38:44-08:00","id":786473,"title":"","content":"I'm disinclined to say you can't, but it's not just something you can do. I'd allow it only if it was a High Satiety devouring, done as a way of actualizing one's self.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-15T14:06:23-08:00","id":786936,"title":"","content":"I'd say it was valid; not something that you could do regularly, but something that could still be done on occasion. It's kind of like taking satisfaction from a joke, even if you yourself were the butt of it: recognizing the humor/hunt and respecting the jokester/hunter without taking it personally. You weren't expecting or opening yourself up for it, but they found a way, and they did it well. Mind, being the subject of it <i>constantly</i> would be pushing things, but once in a blue moon, yeah, I'd see it working.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}